documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s3_p0","content":"It is stated regarding tzedakah that the closer it is to actual deed,","verseSection":"3","subsectionId":"0","sourceHebrew":"עס שטייט בנוגע צו צדקה אז וואס נעענטער זי איז צו פועל ממש,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"3","subSection":1,"sourceHebrew":"עס שטייט בנוגע צו צדקה אז וואס נעענטער זי איז צו פועל ממש,","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s3_p1","content":"the stronger the effect of the tzedakah,","verseSection":"3","subsectionId":"1","sourceHebrew":"איז די פעולת הצדקה אלץ שטארקער,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"3","subSection":2,"sourceHebrew":"איז די פעולת הצדקה אלץ שטארקער,","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s3_p2","content":"as the Gemara<sup>7</sup> says the difference between tzedakah from a man and tzedakah from a woman.","verseSection":"3","subsectionId":"2","sourceHebrew":"ווי די גמרא 7 זאגט דער חילוק צווישן צדקה פון א איש און צדקה פון אן אשה.","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"3","subSection":3,"sourceHebrew":"ווי די גמרא 7 זאגט דער חילוק צווישן צדקה פון א איש און צדקה פון אן אשה.","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p0","content":"Therefore, you will be given","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"0","sourceHebrew":"דערפאר וועט מען אייך געבן","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":1,"sourceHebrew":"דערפאר וועט מען אייך געבן","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p1","content":"(instead of dollars from this country, here),","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"1","sourceHebrew":"(אנשטאט דאלארס פון מדינה זו דארצה\"ב),","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":2,"sourceHebrew":"(אנשטאט דאלארס פון מדינה זו דארצה\"ב),","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p2","content":"which one would then need to exchange for currency of the country to which you are traveling,","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"2","sourceHebrew":"וועלכע מען דארף דערנאך בייטן פאר שטרות פון דער מדינה וואו איר פארט,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":3,"sourceHebrew":"וועלכע מען דארף דערנאך בייטן פאר שטרות פון דער מדינה וואו איר פארט,","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p3","content":"you will be given) currency of the hemisphere of the country to which you are traveling","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"3","sourceHebrew":"וועט מען געבן) שטרות פון חצי כדור המדינה וואו איר פארט","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":4,"sourceHebrew":"וועט מען געבן) שטרות פון חצי כדור המדינה וואו איר פארט","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p4","content":"(currency from Australia) –","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"4","sourceHebrew":"(שטרות מאוסטרליא) –","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":5,"sourceHebrew":"(שטרות מאוסטרליא) –","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p5","content":"this is closer to","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"5","sourceHebrew":"איז דאס נעענטער צו","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":6,"sourceHebrew":"איז דאס נעענטער צו","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p6","content":"(tzedakah b)","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"6","sourceHebrew":"(צדקה ב)","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":7,"sourceHebrew":"(צדקה ב)","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p7","content":"actual deed,","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"7","sourceHebrew":"פועל,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":8,"sourceHebrew":"פועל,","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s4_p8","content":"than currency from here.","verseSection":"4","subsectionId":"8","sourceHebrew":"ווי שטרות דארצה\"ב.","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"4","subSection":9,"sourceHebrew":"ווי שטרות דארצה\"ב.","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p0","content":"You will also be given the sichah where it discusses the recitation of \"Hareini mekabel alai mitzvas aseh shel ve'ahavta lerei'acha kamocha\"","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"0","sourceHebrew":"מ'וועט אייך אויך געבן די שיחה וואו עס רעדט זיך וועגן אמירת \"הריני מקבל עלי מצות עשה של ואהבת לרעך כמוך\"","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":1,"sourceHebrew":"מ'וועט אייך אויך געבן די שיחה וואו עס רעדט זיך וועגן אמירת \"הריני מקבל עלי מצות עשה של ואהבת לרעך כמוך\"","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p1","content":"(before prayer)","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"1","sourceHebrew":"(קודם התפלה)","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":2,"sourceHebrew":"(קודם התפלה)","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p2","content":"and \"Ach tzadikim go'\"","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"2","sourceHebrew":"און \"אך צדיקים גו'\"","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":3,"sourceHebrew":"און \"אך צדיקים גו'\"","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p3","content":"(at the conclusion of prayer),","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"3","sourceHebrew":"(בסיום התפלה),","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":4,"sourceHebrew":"(בסיום התפלה),","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p4","content":"and it is already printed in Likkutei Sichos,","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"4","sourceHebrew":"און ס'איז דאך שוין אלץ אפגעדרוקט אין לקו\"ש,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":5,"sourceHebrew":"און ס'איז דאך שוין אלץ אפגעדרוקט אין לקו\"ש,","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s5_p5","content":"consequently, it precludes speaking about it again.","verseSection":"5","subsectionId":"5","sourceHebrew":"במילא פארשפארט דאס נאכאמאל רעדן וועגן דעם.","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"5","subSection":6,"sourceHebrew":"במילא פארשפארט דאס נאכאמאל רעדן וועגן דעם.","language":"en","documentId":"c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","sourcePath":"books/Sichos Kodesh/Farbrengens/c12dTB8UMOljS7zDKEKE","productionMappingMethod":"unique-normalized-title"}},{"id":"BH_sk_translation_en_sichosKodesh_5744_57440426_3ce1e3dd_s6_p0","content":"[The Rebbe, may he live for many good years, gave to each of the shluchim, may they live, a kuntres \"Sichos\" of 19 Kislev and Shabbos Parshas Vayeishev,","verseSection":"6","subsectionId":"0","sourceHebrew":"[כ\"ק אדמו\"ר שליט\"א נתן לכאו\"א מהשלוחים שיחיו קונטרס \"משיחות\" י\"ט כסלו וש\"פ וישב,","dayuh":{"kind":"translation","verseSection":"6","subSection":1,"sourceHebrew":"[כ\"ק אדמו\"ר שליט\"א נתן לכאו\"א מהשלוחים שיחיו קונטרס \"משיחות\" י\"ט כסלו וש\"פ וישב,",